  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Tummalapenta Naga Pravallika vs The State Of Andhra Pradesh, on 15 June, 2022 Author: Cheekati Manavendranath Roy Bench: Cheekati Manavendranath Roy The Hon'Ble Sri Justice Cheekati Manavendranath Roy Criminal Petition No.4049 of 2022 Order:",
    "facts": "The petitioners are A-1 and A-2 in the above crime. A case under Sections 273, 420 r/w 34 IPC and under Sections 58, 59, 63 of the Food Safety and Standards Act, 2006, was registered against them in the above crime.",
    "arguments": "Learned counsel for the petitioners would submit that this is a covered matter in view of the earlier common orders passed by this Court in Criminal Petition No.3731 of 2018 and batch and Criminal Petition No.5421 of 2019 and batch. Therefore, he would submit that the petitioners, who are similarly placed, are also entitled for quash of the F.I.R.",
    "petitioner_arguments": "Learned counsel for the petitioners would submit that this is a covered matter in view of the earlier common orders passed by this Court in Criminal Petition No.3731 of 2018 and batch and Criminal Petition No.5421 of 2019 and batch. Therefore, he would submit that the petitioners, who are similarly placed, are also entitled for quash of the F.I.R.",
